Introduction

This API is not to resale our services.
A Debrid-Link account is for a personal/normal usage.

All requests are sent by GET, POST and DELETE methods.
The result of request are returned in JSON.
The request body are sent in JSON.
API URL: https://debrid-link.com/api/v2

Contact: help@debrid-link.com
API success result

The HTTP status code is in the 200 range.
The value can be any type (Object, Array, Boolean ...)

{
  "success": true,
  "value": {}
}

Some endpoints return a pagination field like in the following example:
- pagination.page : The active page, starting at 0
- pagination.pages : Total pages
- pagination.next : Next page number. -1 when no next page
- pagination.previous : Previous page number. -1 when no previous page
You can use these informations with the page and perPage query parameter

{
  "success": true,
  "value": {},
  "pagination": {
    "page": 0,
    "pages": 2,
    "next": 1,
    "previous": -1
  }
}

API error result

The HTTP status code is in the 400,500 range.
API return the error code.

{
  "success": false,
  "error": "badToken"
}

Authentification

For each request that require an authentification you must send the Authorization header with the token.
The token can be an access_token obtained with the Oauth2 API (recommended) or a Private API key generated by the user.

Authorization: Bearer [token]

