Changes from API V1 to API V2

    An error result return an HTTP status code in the 400,500 range.
    Updated the result object
        Replaced the attribute result=String by success=Boolean
        Replaced the attribute ERR by error when result is an error
        Removed the attribute ts
    Updated the User object
        Replaced the attribute pseudo by username
    Updated the DownloaderLink object
        Replaced the attribute time by created
        Replaced the attribute link by url
        Replaced the attribute downloadLink by downloadUrl
    Updated the SeedboxTorrent object
        Replaced the attribute addedDate by created
        Replaced the attribute percentDownload by downloadPercent
        Replaced the attribute rateDownload by downloadSpeed
        Replaced the attribute rateUpload by uploadSpeed
        Replaced the attribute files.length by files.size
        Replaced the attribute files.percentDownload by files.downloadPercent
    Updated the File object
        Replaced the attribute time by created
    Removed the /account/login and /account/logout endpoints. You must use Oauth2

